 If you do not have a pair of speed boots spend a wish on them. A crystal
ball can be used to find the portals by applying it and looking for ^.
With your weaponry you should have no difficulties if your speed is maxed
out. A magic marker would be in handy also, you can change blank scrolls
into srolls of taming. Also if you are burdened or stressed you will lose
speed, drop your bag of holding during combat and you should be able to
take out the bad guys. A wand of sleep is useful too, but if you have speed
and are not burdened, you should be able to handle anything.

